    "At actual128 and phone32, the upper cyan field and smooth collars remain stronger visual organizers than the soft stone-plane transitions. This is the same focused crown/collar integration issue retained from round02, with reduced intensity; it is not a renewed whole-construction blocker or a demand for target-pixel identity.",
    "E/W show coherent narrow rounded cap response and useful crown facets. Actual true port samples at published native y473/729 remain clean; no defect is inferred from an interior crown sample or the obsolete round01 groove location.",
    "All18 declared hero/preview files were directly opened. All4 desktop screenshots were additionally inspected in complete lossless actual-resolution strips; all4 phone screenshots and fresh independent phone captures were inspected separately. The framed-panel rhythm persists in native and browser evidence, including fractional cases.",
